abstract: >-
  An independent exploratory paired evaluation of Cognition's Devin agent on
  five historical BugsInPy repairs and five newly constructed software
  defects, comparing SWE-2 Medium and SWE-2 Max under isolated execution with
  hidden behavioral evaluation.
